<title>USA: Country Maid to buy fruit processor.</title>
<headline>Country Maid to buy fruit processor.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Mo. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Maid Foods Inc said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to buy 90 percent of the outstanding shares of CAVA Ltd from Belize Ltd.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>CAVA, based in Corozal, Belize, processes and packs tropical fruit. Its primary exports are papayas, mangos, guavas, star fruit and passion fruit.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
